    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλᾰκόμωρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>always barking, howling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
